Alembic migrations for the Fiftythree backend.

Run from backend/:
    .venv/bin/alembic upgrade head
    .venv/bin/alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

The database URL comes from DATABASE_URL (app.core.config.Settings); alembic.ini does not hold it.
SQLite migrations use render_as_batch=True. The running app never calls Base.metadata.create_all.
